Usage: -u, --enable-universal-plane 	Enable universal plane support
 [OPTIONS] [<DRM device>]

Options:
-h, --help 	Print this help
-c, --config 	 path to configuration file (default /etc/drm-lease-manager.toml)
-v, --verbose 	Enable verbose debug messages
-t, --lease-transfer 	Allow lease transfter to new clients
-k, --keep-on-crash 	Don't close lease on client crash
